WEBVTT

01:31.789 --> 01:34.950
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.110 --> 01:36.990
[Episode 5]

01:37.100 --> 01:39.550
[Qizhi Building]

01:37.190 --> 01:39.270
So what are the two classes formed?

01:39.580 --> 01:41.860
[Uphold virtue, gain knowledge, foster innovation]

01:39.830 --> 01:41.950
Bourgeoisie

01:42.229 --> 01:44.140
and proletariat.

01:44.170 --> 01:45.860
Good, very good.

01:46.220 --> 01:47.710
The chapter on the Industrial Revolution

01:47.710 --> 01:48.950
is essential for the exam.

01:48.990 --> 01:50.220
So after you go home,

01:50.220 --> 01:51.120
review it thoroughly

01:51.150 --> 01:52.440
and memorize it well, okay?

01:52.590 --> 01:53.430
Okay.

01:53.430 --> 01:54.590
Alright, class dismissed.

01:54.830 --> 01:55.590
Stand up.

01:57.590 --> 02:00.110
Goodbye, Madam.

02:00.110 --> 02:00.920
Goodbye, everyone.

02:04.360 --> 02:07.470
[Uphold virtue, gain knowledge, foster innovation]

02:07.390 --> 02:08.470
Ms. Xia.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.229
Siyi, what's wrong?

02:10.229 --> 02:11.830
Why didn't Chen Rui come today?

02:11.850 --> 02:12.990
He is on sick leave.

02:13.600 --> 02:14.710
What happened to him?

02:14.910 --> 02:16.550
He said he accidentally

02:16.570 --> 02:18.040
fractured his lower leg last night.

02:18.079 --> 02:19.590
He's in the hospital now.

02:24.690 --> 02:26.950
[Honghuai No. 1 Middle School]

02:26.000 --> 02:27.220
Pretty little white girl,

02:27.390 --> 02:28.240
let's go home.

02:30.260 --> 02:31.010
Siyi.

02:32.860 --> 02:33.720
Siyi!

02:33.790 --> 02:35.440
You guys go back first. I have something to do.

02:36.980 --> 02:37.940
Don't be like this.

02:37.990 --> 02:39.470
Wanghe just wanted to help you.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.910
It's just that his approach was wrong.

02:40.910 --> 02:41.870
He won't do that again.

02:41.890 --> 02:42.850
Be good and get on.

02:43.250 --> 02:44.480
I really have something to do.

02:44.700 --> 02:45.780
Chen Rui fell last night.

02:45.829 --> 02:46.470
He broke his leg.

02:46.470 --> 02:47.600
I'm going to the hospital to check on him.

02:48.840 --> 02:50.120
You have to solve the problem

02:50.150 --> 02:51.760
immediately.

02:51.930 --> 02:53.660
A ship docked along the shore

02:53.680 --> 02:56.280
contaminated the farmland due to a diesel leak.

02:56.380 --> 02:58.170
Now, the locals have suffered losses.

02:58.250 --> 02:59.930
I contacted the Canal Administration Bureau a few times,

02:59.960 --> 03:00.920
but they can't even find the ship.

03:00.940 --> 03:01.760
I'm going in.

03:03.230 --> 03:04.350
Listen,

03:04.400 --> 03:06.030
if you don't solve it now,

03:06.060 --> 03:07.420
the farmers won't stand for it.

03:07.450 --> 03:08.610
How about this? Apply for some money

03:08.630 --> 03:09.590
from the city.

03:09.610 --> 03:11.390
We'll install cameras at the docks

03:11.420 --> 03:13.240
and along the shoreline.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.640
If it happens again in the future,

03:14.660 --> 03:15.630
either they will be fined

03:15.660 --> 03:16.990
or their ships will be impounded!

03:18.040 --> 03:19.210
My coat.

03:19.230 --> 03:20.200
What took you so long?

03:20.240 --> 03:21.079
Look how busy I am.

03:21.120 --> 03:22.110
I'm at my wit's end.

03:22.110 --> 03:23.510
I had a reception task in my company.

03:23.550 --> 03:24.990
Someone from the City Writers Association came.

03:25.010 --> 03:26.740
The Writers Association or Hairdressers Association?

03:26.770 --> 03:27.840
Look how busy I am,

03:27.870 --> 03:29.780
yet you still had the mood for this!

03:29.820 --> 03:31.329
Alright, don't be angry.

03:31.730 --> 03:32.520
His leg

03:32.670 --> 03:33.310
is in a cast,

03:33.350 --> 03:35.060
and he is under observation in the hospital.

03:35.100 --> 03:35.900
He's fine now.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.240
His leg may be fine,

03:37.270 --> 03:38.030
but what about his studies?

03:38.050 --> 03:39.620
The current period is of critical importance.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.600
What happened last night?

03:41.630 --> 03:42.630
In the middle of the night,

03:42.650 --> 03:44.780
your son wanted to go to the police station to bail out some delinquent teenagers.

03:44.810 --> 03:46.050
How could I let him go?

03:46.300 --> 03:48.120
They're all decent children.

03:48.140 --> 03:49.540
Don't label them indiscreetly.

03:49.570 --> 03:51.290
Why would the police arrest decent children?

03:51.310 --> 03:52.940
Did the police arrest the wrong people?

03:53.310 --> 03:56.490
[Nurse Station]

03:53.579 --> 03:54.390
Here.

03:56.860 --> 03:57.840
Nurse, excuse me.

03:57.440 --> 03:58.760
[Nurse Station]

03:57.880 --> 03:59.590
I want to know if you took in a patient

03:59.610 --> 04:00.880
who had a fracture yesterday?

04:01.120 --> 04:02.160
Which ward is he in?

04:02.550 --> 04:03.870
A thigh fracture or a lower leg fracture?

04:03.890 --> 04:04.580
A lower leg fracture.

04:05.650 --> 04:08.430
[Expert care, thoughtful attention]

04:06.570 --> 04:07.960
Chen Rui, right?

04:08.000 --> 04:08.670
-Yes.
-Yes.

04:08.670 --> 04:09.550
Which ward is he in?

04:09.570 --> 04:10.870
That's the patient's privacy.

04:10.930 --> 04:11.790
If you want to visit him,

04:11.840 --> 04:12.950
you need to call him

04:12.950 --> 04:13.990
and ask a family member to come here to take you there.

04:14.020 --> 04:15.110
She is a family member of his.

04:15.110 --> 04:15.700
She's his child bride.

04:15.700 --> 04:16.820
She just came from the country...

04:16.700 --> 04:17.450
[Nurse Station]

04:18.899 --> 04:19.899
Nurse,

04:20.070 --> 04:21.829
we are all Chen Rui's classmates

04:21.860 --> 04:23.000
and good friends.

04:23.210 --> 04:25.010
Just let us go in to take a look at him.

04:25.070 --> 04:25.680
Yeah.

04:25.720 --> 04:27.450
I'm sorry, but it's the hospital's rule.

04:27.490 --> 04:29.510
Without the permission of patients or their family members,

04:29.560 --> 04:30.510
visitors are not allowed to go in.

04:29.750 --> 04:31.650
[Expert care, thoughtful attention]

04:32.700 --> 04:33.480
Fenghua.

04:33.580 --> 04:34.970
Fenghua, what's wrong?

04:35.200 --> 04:36.230
-Fenghua!
-Fenghua!

04:36.270 --> 04:38.150
Nurse! Come quickly and take a look at her!

04:36.950 --> 04:38.730
[Nurse Station]

04:38.180 --> 04:40.070
What's wrong, Fenghua? Are you okay?

04:40.150 --> 04:40.870
Feng... Fenghua!

04:40.870 --> 04:41.720
What's wrong?

04:41.750 --> 04:44.260
I'm experiencing chest pain. My heart condition has acted up.

04:42.960 --> 04:44.040
[Cherish life, nurture health]

04:44.159 --> 04:44.900
[Bed 2824, Chen Rui]

04:44.659 --> 04:45.510
Are you alright?

04:45.540 --> 04:46.300
Are you okay?

04:46.940 --> 04:48.900
[Nurse Station]

04:46.990 --> 04:48.500
Hang in there, Fenghua!

04:48.590 --> 04:50.430
-Fenghua!
-Fenghua!

04:50.460 --> 04:52.130
What medicine do you usually take?

04:53.000 --> 04:54.770
Indigestion tablets.

04:55.140 --> 04:55.990
What?

05:01.350 --> 05:02.650
I'm sorry about yesterday.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.800
I couldn't be of much help.

05:05.490 --> 05:06.700
It was a false alarm.

05:07.530 --> 05:08.590
Is your leg alright?

05:08.590 --> 05:09.470
I have a lower leg fracture.

05:09.670 --> 05:10.550
Does that sound alright to you?

05:11.550 --> 05:13.080
Let me treat it for you.

05:13.630 --> 05:14.800
Keep your hand to yourself.

05:15.590 --> 05:16.760
When can you be discharged?

05:17.920 --> 05:19.540
It takes much time to recover from a fracture.

05:19.770 --> 05:21.060
So probably in two to three months.

05:21.230 --> 05:23.470
H-How do you use the bathroom with that leg?

05:23.540 --> 05:25.390
You plan to do one-legged squats?

05:25.390 --> 05:27.300
Why didn't you say he plans to do the Thomas Flair?

05:27.380 --> 05:28.670
Then there would be shit everywhere.

05:28.670 --> 05:30.550
Enough, you three. Don't you think it's disgusting?

05:31.660 --> 05:33.870
I'll copy my class notes for you later.

05:33.900 --> 05:35.900
If there's anything you don't understand, just write it down. I'll ask our teachers later.

05:36.070 --> 05:38.510
It's okay. Attending classes isn't that important in the third year of high school.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.270
I'll just do more exercises.

05:39.290 --> 05:41.210
You don't need Siyi's help with that.

05:41.250 --> 05:42.420
I have a plan for doing exercises.

05:42.420 --> 05:43.030
I... How about going to my place to do exercises?

05:43.070 --> 05:44.150
What does it have to do with you?

05:45.150 --> 05:46.590
Stop messing around from now on.

05:46.590 --> 05:47.460
Okay?

05:47.490 --> 05:48.990
What if you had been arrested yesterday

05:48.990 --> 05:50.150
and got a record?

05:50.730 --> 05:51.530
Alright.

05:51.550 --> 05:52.350
Enough.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.850
You're behaving just like your mom.

05:54.520 --> 05:55.960
It's for your own good.

05:56.030 --> 05:57.270
Fine.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.190
I promise it won't happen again.

05:59.230 --> 06:00.080
From now on,

06:00.530 --> 06:02.040
I will never act recklessly.

06:02.310 --> 06:03.110
Oh, come on.

06:03.150 --> 06:04.470
Your words are like farts.

06:04.620 --> 06:06.000
Then I won't say anything.

06:06.900 --> 06:07.980
I'll just fart!

06:09.480 --> 06:10.470
What the hell?

06:10.470 --> 06:12.390
I can't stand you!

06:12.990 --> 06:14.410
Fenghua!

06:17.430 --> 06:18.660
Sorry, sir.

06:18.680 --> 06:19.300
It still reeks.

06:19.320 --> 06:21.930
What are you doing? You're in a ward!

06:24.510 --> 06:26.650
We're leaving. We'll visit you later.

06:26.710 --> 06:27.630
Take care and get well soon.

06:27.630 --> 06:28.870
-Okay. Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

06:28.870 --> 06:29.920
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

06:31.040 --> 06:31.800
Siyi.

06:32.670 --> 06:33.830
Chen Rui does exercises too?

06:34.270 --> 06:35.920
How are his grades?

06:36.090 --> 06:36.890
Why do you want to know?

06:37.270 --> 06:38.070
Just asking.

06:38.950 --> 06:41.190
Last semester, he was one of the top ten students in our grade.

06:41.220 --> 06:42.500
His performance is unstable.

06:42.520 --> 06:43.780
How so?

06:43.820 --> 06:45.820
His grades drop when he spends too much time with you.

06:45.840 --> 06:46.800
If you stay away from him,

06:46.830 --> 06:48.150
he can be admitted to Harvard University.

06:48.170 --> 06:49.630
Harbin Buddhist Academy.

06:49.659 --> 06:50.470
Would his mother be willing to let him

06:50.470 --> 06:51.710
become a monk at such a young age?

06:55.300 --> 06:56.670
Hello, Auntie.

06:56.700 --> 06:57.890
-Auntie.
-Hello, Auntie.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.909
I wouldn't be willing.

06:59.030 --> 07:01.190
Your parents wouldn't be willing either, right?

07:01.030 --> 07:03.100
[Fire Extinguisher Location]

07:01.220 --> 07:02.660
The national college entrance exam is just around the corner.

07:03.420 --> 07:05.070
Pay all your attention to your studies.

07:05.090 --> 07:05.970
Do you hear me?

07:05.930 --> 07:07.380
[Fire Extinguisher Location]

07:08.030 --> 07:08.700
Siyi,

07:09.250 --> 07:11.150
do you have time to chat with me?

07:11.210 --> 07:12.320
-Yes, she does.
-Yes, she does.

07:12.530 --> 07:13.420
We're leaving first.

07:13.470 --> 07:13.910
Goodbye, Auntie.

07:13.910 --> 07:14.670
We'll wait for you at the gate.

07:14.830 --> 07:15.620
Goodbye, Auntie.

07:27.180 --> 07:27.790
Here.

07:27.790 --> 07:28.390
Thank you.

07:29.030 --> 07:29.710
Please have a seat.

07:30.790 --> 07:32.060
I should thank you.

07:32.300 --> 07:35.090
You just said in the ward that you'd copy notes for Chen Rui.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.840
I'm truly touched.

07:36.860 --> 07:39.140
It's the least I can do. He's always been good to me.

07:40.100 --> 07:42.150
During Chen Rui's hospitalization,

07:42.390 --> 07:44.090
can you come to live in our house?

07:47.110 --> 07:48.450
Here's the thing.

07:49.540 --> 07:50.610
When I go to work

07:50.630 --> 07:51.950
in the morning,

07:51.980 --> 07:54.180
I'll give you a ride to your school.

07:54.220 --> 07:56.150
After school, you'll come to the hospital

07:56.190 --> 07:58.680
to deliver the notes to Chen Rui and explain them to him.

07:58.710 --> 07:59.920
Then I'll drive you home.

08:00.070 --> 08:02.230
In this way, it won't waste your time

08:02.230 --> 08:03.470
or affect your studies.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.390
And most importantly,

08:06.220 --> 08:07.590
you're in the third year of high school now.

08:07.910 --> 08:09.160
Model students

08:09.230 --> 08:10.590
like you and Chen Rui

08:10.590 --> 08:12.350
should pay all your attention

08:12.350 --> 08:14.560
to your studies.

08:14.640 --> 08:16.790
You shouldn't hang out

08:16.790 --> 08:18.480
with those naughty people anymore.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.750
You should stay away from them

08:19.770 --> 08:20.560
or even

08:21.110 --> 08:22.450
stop associating with them.

08:26.260 --> 08:28.580
Alright, it's settled then.

08:30.450 --> 08:31.250
Auntie.

08:32.120 --> 08:37.549
[No smoking]

08:32.360 --> 08:33.880
Do you have an elder brother?

08:35.080 --> 08:36.140
I have a younger brother.

08:36.159 --> 08:37.090
He's in our hometown.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.830
If you were given a chance

08:39.870 --> 08:41.350
to become the mayor

08:41.590 --> 08:42.720
on the condition

08:42.720 --> 08:44.770
that you sever ties with your younger brother,

08:44.920 --> 08:45.950
would you accept?

08:47.790 --> 08:50.570
Xie Wanghe, Xingchi, Haikuo,

08:50.590 --> 08:51.720
and Xia Fenghua

08:52.300 --> 08:53.530
might not be considered

08:53.570 --> 08:55.350
model students in other people's eyes.

08:55.770 --> 08:57.200
But to me,

08:57.500 --> 09:00.600
they are like my own brothers and sisters.

09:00.950 --> 09:02.850
I understand why you said that,

09:03.010 --> 09:04.030
but I hope

09:04.030 --> 09:05.140
in the future, you won't

09:05.140 --> 09:06.390
speak ill of them in front of me again.

09:07.690 --> 09:08.460
Thank you.

09:09.090 --> 09:15.860
[No smoking]

09:20.130 --> 09:21.580
What did Ms. Gu talk to you about?

09:21.650 --> 09:22.350
Nothing.

09:22.350 --> 09:24.170
She just asked about Chen Rui's studies.

09:24.750 --> 09:25.830
You guys leave without me later.

09:25.870 --> 09:26.840
I need to go to the bank.

09:27.040 --> 09:27.880
To do what?

09:29.040 --> 09:29.920
To transfer money to my mom.

09:30.710 --> 09:31.870
Where did you get the money?

09:33.110 --> 09:34.320
I'm asking you. Where did you get the money?

09:34.320 --> 09:35.510
It's none of your business.

09:35.590 --> 09:36.640
Ma Siyi!

09:36.720 --> 09:38.420
You didn't really go sell your blood, did you?

09:38.440 --> 09:39.490
We agreed before

09:39.520 --> 09:40.940
that we'd face difficulties together.

09:40.990 --> 09:41.430
If you dare to...

09:41.430 --> 09:42.310
No need for that!

09:42.310 --> 09:44.310
From now on, I'll solve my problems myself.

09:44.310 --> 09:45.430
You don't need to worry about me.

09:45.430 --> 09:47.430
And I certainly don't need you to do stupid things for me.

09:47.810 --> 09:49.870
I said I won't take risks anymore. Isn't that enough?

09:49.900 --> 09:51.460
I know you're doing this out of kindness,

09:52.040 --> 09:53.320
but I can't accept it.

09:53.710 --> 09:55.580
I don't want to owe you such a big favor either.

09:55.940 --> 09:56.620
I can't repay your kindness.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.750
I've never asked you to repay my kindness!

09:57.750 --> 09:58.960
Xie Wanghe!

09:59.460 --> 10:01.620
Can you stop thinking about all that nonsense?

10:01.640 --> 10:02.960
If you don't want to go to college,

10:02.990 --> 10:04.310
drop out now!

10:04.330 --> 10:05.900
Then raise funds to start a business.

10:05.930 --> 10:06.850
If you want to go to college,

10:06.870 --> 10:08.980
start your revision from now on!

10:09.030 --> 10:09.750
Please

10:09.770 --> 10:11.540
be responsible for yourself.

10:38.490 --> 10:39.570
You scared me.

10:39.670 --> 10:40.560
Childish.

10:42.530 --> 10:43.230
What?

10:43.500 --> 10:44.600
Are you sad and indignant again?

10:46.500 --> 10:47.430
It's none of your business.

10:48.080 --> 10:50.570
You have never talked back to Siyi,

10:50.660 --> 10:52.510
but you always talk back to me.

10:52.510 --> 10:53.620
Do you treat people differently?

10:53.620 --> 10:54.870
I do as I please. Do you have a problem with that?

10:54.910 --> 10:55.660
Yes.

10:56.790 --> 10:57.870
Just go. Leave me alone.

10:57.900 --> 10:58.750
I want to be alone.

11:00.030 --> 11:00.630
Call me Auntie.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.030
Remove your hand.

11:02.160 --> 11:02.830
No.

11:04.730 --> 11:05.640
You're so annoying.

11:11.070 --> 11:12.790
Siyi was right.

11:13.600 --> 11:16.330
You should seriously think about your future.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.230
Why don't you think about your future?

11:19.090 --> 11:21.090
Given my brain, it's pointless for me to think about it.

11:21.120 --> 11:22.620
I want to go to Peking University.

11:22.670 --> 11:23.970
But that's just my wishful thinking.

11:24.690 --> 11:25.550
You're different.

11:27.270 --> 11:28.200
How am I different?

11:29.550 --> 11:30.860
Since you were a kid,

11:31.030 --> 11:32.310
you've managed to achieve anything

11:32.330 --> 11:33.880
you put your mind to and you wanted to do,

11:33.930 --> 11:35.020
including studying.

11:35.430 --> 11:36.910
If there's enough scholarship,

11:37.030 --> 11:38.150
you could be the top student of the class.

11:39.560 --> 11:41.660
Are you saying I only care about money?

11:41.840 --> 11:43.340
What I'm saying is

11:43.600 --> 11:45.100
if I were half as smart as you,

11:45.100 --> 11:46.860
I would definitely study hard

11:46.900 --> 11:48.020
to be admitted to a good university.

11:48.040 --> 11:49.450
Then my parents would be overjoyed.

11:50.390 --> 11:51.330
You're not stupid.

11:51.870 --> 11:53.330
It's just that you always

11:54.670 --> 11:55.820
experience brain farts.

12:05.220 --> 12:07.500
Actually, I totally understand why Siyi was angry.

12:09.390 --> 12:10.820
You're so smart,

12:11.040 --> 12:13.110
but you've constantly wasted your time and talent

12:13.380 --> 12:14.930
and made your parents worried.

12:14.960 --> 12:15.860
It's really not okay.

12:16.280 --> 12:17.850
You're talking about me?

12:18.660 --> 12:20.340
You haven't made your parents worried?

12:23.840 --> 12:24.840
Anyway,

12:25.030 --> 12:27.350
we all hope you can be more reliable

12:27.900 --> 12:29.970
and put your brain to good use.

12:30.540 --> 12:32.020
As for the definition of good use,

12:32.040 --> 12:33.440
it's for you to decide.

12:35.790 --> 12:37.680
When my dad drinks too much,

12:38.220 --> 12:39.180
he would complain sometimes,

12:39.850 --> 12:42.040
regretting he didn't study hard when he was young.

12:42.410 --> 12:44.300
That's why he can only do seafaring all these years.

12:44.680 --> 12:46.360
He's never made any great achievement.

12:48.330 --> 12:50.110
I sincerely hope

12:50.310 --> 12:52.230
when you're at my dad's age,

12:52.630 --> 12:53.510
you won't complain,

12:53.510 --> 12:54.710
regret,

12:54.740 --> 12:55.630
or make those who love you worried

12:56.140 --> 12:57.920
when you drink too much.

13:22.310 --> 13:23.020
Mom,

13:24.100 --> 13:26.060
do you think I can be successful in the future?

13:28.710 --> 13:30.510
Of course you can.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.800
My son

13:32.110 --> 13:33.470
is smart.

13:33.470 --> 13:34.760
You can succeed in anything.

13:35.350 --> 13:36.110
It

13:36.130 --> 13:37.490
runs in our Liang family.

13:37.510 --> 13:38.280
You're better than your father.

13:39.850 --> 13:40.910
Then how about

13:41.710 --> 13:42.870
me starting a business?

13:44.470 --> 13:45.460
What kind of business?

13:46.560 --> 13:48.210
I have a few ideas.

13:48.230 --> 13:49.430
If any of my ideas works,

13:49.470 --> 13:50.460
I can make a lot of money.

13:50.700 --> 13:51.890
But...

13:52.100 --> 13:53.710
I need your support.

13:54.010 --> 13:55.110
What kind of support?

13:58.230 --> 13:59.750
You're trying to cheat me out of money again?

13:59.770 --> 14:00.770
No, no, no.

14:02.590 --> 14:03.590
I want to drop out of school.

14:07.290 --> 14:08.370
Mom! Mom!

14:08.410 --> 14:09.600
Have you lost your mind?

14:09.600 --> 14:09.990
You...

14:09.990 --> 14:10.550
Say that again! I dare you!

14:10.590 --> 14:11.360
I won't drop out!

14:11.360 --> 14:12.470
I won't drop out, okay?

14:12.470 --> 14:13.430
I was just saying.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.470
Don't ever say that again!

14:14.590 --> 14:15.650
Listen,

14:15.790 --> 14:16.830
you can't have

14:16.870 --> 14:17.900
this idea.

14:17.920 --> 14:19.170
The Xie family

14:19.200 --> 14:20.240
is counting on you

14:20.270 --> 14:22.340
to bring honor with a high school diploma.

14:22.420 --> 14:23.680
Do you understand?

14:24.930 --> 14:26.690
But my dad didn't finish school, right?

14:26.720 --> 14:28.760
That's why he's ended up like this!

14:28.770 --> 14:29.950
Apart from seafaring,

14:29.980 --> 14:31.420
he has no other skills.

14:32.190 --> 14:34.070
His business is getting worse day by day,

14:34.090 --> 14:35.830
but there is nothing he can do!

14:36.230 --> 14:37.790
Look how much he's aged

14:39.130 --> 14:40.620
these years.

14:51.670 --> 14:56.980
[Dingsheng Building]

14:57.080 --> 15:00.680
[Dingsheng Building Materials Company]

15:21.330 --> 15:26.470
[Welcome]

15:26.590 --> 15:27.240
[Chairman's Office]

15:27.550 --> 15:28.900
[Chairman's Office]

15:50.310 --> 15:51.100
A pair of sixes.

15:51.150 --> 15:51.900
A pair of sixes. Come on.

15:51.930 --> 15:52.760
Pass or not?

15:52.800 --> 15:53.700
A pair of aces.

15:53.830 --> 15:54.190
Sun.

15:54.190 --> 15:55.110
Pass.

15:55.110 --> 15:55.750
Let's talk.

15:56.120 --> 15:56.830
Wait a second.

15:56.830 --> 15:57.590
Let me finish this round.

15:57.590 --> 15:58.080
Pass or not?

15:58.110 --> 15:59.380
Show him a bomb!

16:01.990 --> 16:02.710
I quit.

16:02.710 --> 16:03.470
Take it.

16:03.470 --> 16:04.100
Here.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.590
You must have cheated.

16:08.120 --> 16:08.990
Where are you going?

16:09.800 --> 16:10.920
I'm going to the bathroom.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.110
Am I not allowed to go?

16:12.310 --> 16:12.830
Go ahead.

16:17.230 --> 16:18.350
What good luck,

16:18.350 --> 16:18.830
right?

16:30.350 --> 16:32.590
About the money, today,

16:32.590 --> 16:33.230
can you...

16:34.100 --> 16:35.050
Hold on.

16:43.040 --> 16:44.730
They haven't paid me yet.

16:44.760 --> 16:46.250
How am I supposed to pay you?

16:46.530 --> 16:47.710
Should I rob them?

16:47.780 --> 16:48.760
It can't be.

16:49.460 --> 16:50.350
As far as I know,

16:50.350 --> 16:51.470
Hengtong Group

16:51.470 --> 16:54.460
already paid you last month.

16:54.480 --> 16:57.880
I heard they paid over three million yuan to you.

16:58.520 --> 16:59.640
What do you mean, Xie?

17:00.460 --> 17:01.810
You don't trust us?

17:02.830 --> 17:04.349
That's not what I meant.

17:04.349 --> 17:06.430
You know how close we are.

17:13.349 --> 17:13.750
Sun,

17:13.829 --> 17:15.109
you should at least tell me when.

17:15.109 --> 17:15.740
Let go!

17:16.940 --> 17:18.430
Stop pulling me.

17:19.480 --> 17:20.310
Well,

17:20.579 --> 17:21.349
look.

17:21.349 --> 17:23.740
You know I'm a person who values loyalty and friendship.

17:23.770 --> 17:24.470
Right?

17:24.470 --> 17:25.069
Well...

17:25.109 --> 17:26.349
To be honest,

17:26.349 --> 17:27.440
I wouldn't

17:27.680 --> 17:29.200
care too much

17:29.230 --> 17:30.870
about money normally.

17:30.880 --> 17:31.890
But you should understand

17:31.930 --> 17:33.520
business on the canal

17:33.540 --> 17:35.350
has been really tough lately.

17:35.380 --> 17:37.740
My family can barely make ends meet.

17:37.770 --> 17:39.650
Otherwise, I wouldn't have come to pester you like this.

17:41.390 --> 17:42.470
You can't make ends meet?

17:42.470 --> 17:43.350
That's right.

17:43.490 --> 17:45.770
Then sell your ship.

17:45.810 --> 17:46.830
That ship

17:46.830 --> 17:47.710
is worth some money.

17:48.040 --> 17:49.470
You're suggesting I should sell my ship?

17:49.470 --> 17:50.670
What am I supposed to live on then?

17:51.790 --> 17:53.630
You already can't make ends meet, right?

17:54.350 --> 17:55.110
Xie,

17:55.600 --> 17:56.480
listen,

17:56.870 --> 17:58.910
it's not that I don't want to pay my debts.

17:58.930 --> 18:00.140
Understand?

18:00.920 --> 18:03.410
There are just too many construction sites.

18:03.440 --> 18:05.200
I need money in all kinds of things.

18:05.220 --> 18:07.100
If I could manage to free up some money,

18:07.140 --> 18:08.600
I wouldn't have defaulted on my debts.

18:09.930 --> 18:11.160
Why don't you come with me?

18:11.230 --> 18:12.230
Come with me and take a look.

18:12.250 --> 18:12.890
Come.

18:12.920 --> 18:13.870
Come and see for yourself.

18:13.870 --> 18:14.640
Come.

18:14.680 --> 18:15.150
Take a look.

18:14.860 --> 18:18.180
[Dingsheng Building Materials Company]

18:15.470 --> 18:16.570
Have a look.

18:16.990 --> 18:18.390
Look around this room.

18:18.430 --> 18:19.350
If there is anything you like,

18:19.350 --> 18:20.100
just take it.

18:23.100 --> 18:23.830
Look at this.

18:23.830 --> 18:24.780
It's Chunghwa.

18:24.830 --> 18:25.810
Fifty yuan a pack.

18:25.850 --> 18:26.610
Take it.

18:26.630 --> 18:27.530
Take it.

18:27.610 --> 18:28.350
Sun,

18:28.350 --> 18:29.780
what's this about?

18:29.830 --> 18:31.070
Aren't you here to collect debts?

18:31.100 --> 18:32.890
Is there a problem with paying the debts with goods?

18:33.470 --> 18:34.070
Take it.

18:34.110 --> 18:35.190
We're brothers.

18:35.190 --> 18:36.190
No need to be polite.

18:37.220 --> 18:38.640
Listen, Crippled Sun,

18:38.860 --> 18:41.160
you can't bully honest people.

18:42.190 --> 18:43.380
This trophy

18:44.910 --> 18:46.050
is made of crystal.

18:46.080 --> 18:47.070
It's worth quite a lot of money.

18:47.100 --> 18:48.100
Take it.

18:48.120 --> 18:49.150
Take them.

18:49.340 --> 18:50.510
Let me find you more.

18:50.710 --> 18:51.760
Let me find you more.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.600
Just tell me!

18:53.630 --> 18:54.830
Are you going to pay back the money or not?

18:57.640 --> 18:58.310
Don't move!

18:58.330 --> 18:59.240
Don't move!

18:59.270 --> 19:00.760
You should pay back the money you owe me.

19:00.780 --> 19:02.010
If you don't give me the money today,

19:02.070 --> 19:03.670
I'll crack your head with this!

19:03.670 --> 19:04.310
Believe it or not!

19:04.330 --> 19:05.030
What?

19:05.090 --> 19:05.450
Go away!

19:05.470 --> 19:05.910
Don't move!

19:05.940 --> 19:06.990
Nobody moves!

19:09.790 --> 19:10.740
Xie,

19:10.770 --> 19:12.140
I dare you.

19:12.170 --> 19:13.970
You were a bachelor.

19:14.000 --> 19:16.090
You had nothing to worry about.

19:16.130 --> 19:17.800
But now it's different.

19:17.840 --> 19:19.430
You have a son and a wife.

19:19.930 --> 19:21.420
Aren't you worried something might happen to them?

19:21.440 --> 19:22.680
I dare you!

19:22.720 --> 19:24.280
Your son, Xie Wanghe,

19:24.300 --> 19:26.470
is in Class 3, Grade 3 of Honghuai No. 7 High School.

19:26.690 --> 19:27.370
On weekends,

19:27.390 --> 19:29.230
he often goes to the internet cafe on the side street.

19:29.250 --> 19:30.990
How many Achilles tendons does he have for me to cut?

19:50.170 --> 19:51.470
Stop!

19:57.070 --> 19:57.830
Watch out!

19:57.850 --> 19:58.560
Zhen!

20:00.280 --> 20:01.230
Zhen!

20:01.230 --> 20:02.090
Cut! Apply the blood!

20:02.140 --> 20:03.580
Cut! Pass!

20:03.600 --> 20:04.670
Clap the slate!

20:05.060 --> 20:06.400
It's noon. It's time for lunch.

20:06.430 --> 20:07.230
Then have lunch.

20:07.230 --> 20:08.110
Time for lunch!

20:08.160 --> 20:08.990
All departments, hurry up and have your lunch!

20:08.990 --> 20:10.230
I lost my balance just now.

20:10.230 --> 20:11.510
Can we do it again?

20:11.510 --> 20:12.350
Director.

20:12.390 --> 20:13.150
Director.

20:16.030 --> 20:16.830
Director.

20:22.680 --> 20:24.050
What's wrong with you?

20:26.110 --> 20:26.910
You...

20:26.950 --> 20:28.550
The payment has been delayed for a week.

20:28.550 --> 20:29.910
What's wrong with you?

20:31.110 --> 20:32.760
The money must be paid within the next few days.

20:32.770 --> 20:34.260
I'm telling you. Bye.

20:35.870 --> 20:36.730
Great Heroine,

20:38.370 --> 20:39.690
you're about to wrap, right?

20:40.190 --> 20:41.470
There are still two scenes tomorrow.

20:41.470 --> 20:43.500
I booked a ticket to go back the day after tomorrow.

20:43.520 --> 20:45.220
Why are you in such a hurry to go back?

20:45.280 --> 20:47.000
A new drama is about to start filming in Beijing.

20:47.000 --> 20:47.790
The second female lead

20:47.810 --> 20:49.160
has over 300 scenes.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.590
You should go audition for the role.

20:51.450 --> 20:52.240
Forget it.

20:52.280 --> 20:54.180
My son is about to take the college entrance exam.

20:54.230 --> 20:55.670
They can't manage without me at home.

20:55.950 --> 20:57.560
I've only been away for a few days.

20:57.580 --> 20:59.050
My husband is about to go crazy.

20:59.990 --> 21:01.130
Listen,

21:01.160 --> 21:03.280
the male and female leads are both A-list stars.

21:03.290 --> 21:04.580
The script is excellent.

21:04.620 --> 21:05.920
The director is from Beijing Film Academy.

21:05.940 --> 21:07.020
He's very talented.

21:07.020 --> 21:08.490
You should seize this opportunity.

21:10.110 --> 21:11.630
What drama did he direct before?

21:11.660 --> 21:12.580
A lot.

21:12.610 --> 21:13.860
I'll send you the information later.

21:13.890 --> 21:14.790
How about this?

21:14.820 --> 21:16.390
Call your husband and ask him about it first.

21:16.390 --> 21:17.230
If he's okay with it,

21:17.270 --> 21:18.510
I'll call them.

21:18.530 --> 21:20.270
Then you go to Beijing for an audition as soon as possible.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.230
Okay?

21:22.300 --> 21:23.360
I need to take this call.

21:23.600 --> 21:25.350
Hurry up and call your husband to ask him.

21:25.590 --> 21:26.230
Go ahead.

21:28.280 --> 21:30.190
What's wrong with you? You still want to delay it?

21:31.270 --> 21:32.550
If you do that,

21:32.580 --> 21:34.130
I'll tear up the contract.

21:42.080 --> 21:43.080
Master, you have an incoming call.

21:43.380 --> 21:43.940
From whom?

21:43.970 --> 21:44.890
Madam.

21:45.920 --> 21:47.050
Come on. You do it.

21:48.020 --> 21:48.990
Make it thin.

21:49.010 --> 21:49.800
Don't break it.

21:49.830 --> 21:50.520
Got it.

21:50.540 --> 21:51.190
Okay.

21:56.800 --> 21:58.310
I'm wrapping up filming tomorrow.

21:59.140 --> 22:00.250
So soon?

22:00.960 --> 22:02.970
I just came to help Ai Linlin.

22:03.000 --> 22:04.210
It's not a big role.

22:04.810 --> 22:05.810
How's everything at home?

22:06.000 --> 22:07.250
Everything's fine at home.

22:09.420 --> 22:11.310
So you'll be back tomorrow then?

22:11.310 --> 22:11.910
Right?

22:14.180 --> 22:16.030
I need to go to Beijing.

22:17.040 --> 22:18.500
What are you going to Beijing for?

22:18.540 --> 22:19.690
I'm going for an audition.

22:19.760 --> 22:20.560
The lead actor and actress in this show

22:20.590 --> 22:21.870
are both A-list celebrities.

22:21.890 --> 22:23.450
The script is pretty good too.

22:29.350 --> 22:30.110
Hello?

22:30.730 --> 22:31.650
Go on.

22:32.510 --> 22:34.130
I'm just going to audition for a role.

22:34.180 --> 22:34.710
The second female lead.

22:34.710 --> 22:35.590
If I don't get it,

22:35.610 --> 22:36.860
I'll come back as soon as possible.

22:37.500 --> 22:38.970
What if you do get it?

22:39.140 --> 22:40.720
If I get it, I'll play it, of course!

22:40.780 --> 22:42.770
It has an all-star cast and is set to air on satellite TV channels.

22:42.870 --> 22:43.700
It's bound to be a hit.

22:43.950 --> 22:44.830
Luo Zhimei.

22:44.850 --> 22:45.870
Time to climb the tree.

22:46.550 --> 22:48.110
I have to go.

22:48.140 --> 22:49.280
Okay, okay.

22:49.310 --> 22:50.320
Go ahead, go ahead.

22:50.350 --> 22:51.250
Give it a good try.

22:55.770 --> 22:56.450
Luo Zhimei.

22:56.470 --> 22:56.840
Hurry up.

22:56.870 --> 22:57.870
Time to climb the tree. Hurry up.

22:57.890 --> 22:58.650
Coming.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.070
Hurry up.

22:59.150 --> 22:59.550
What are you doing?

22:59.550 --> 23:00.680
Stop dawdling.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.390
Director,

23:01.430 --> 23:02.380
Luo Zhimei is here.

23:10.420 --> 23:13.850
[Supo Town Cultural Museum]

23:10.710 --> 23:11.790
Have you seen Curator?

23:11.810 --> 23:12.820
He's setting up the exhibition.

23:13.910 --> 23:14.470
Lower it.

23:14.470 --> 23:14.830
Down. Down.

23:14.870 --> 23:15.750
Gently, gently.

23:15.750 --> 23:16.310
Easy.

23:16.310 --> 23:17.150
Down.

23:17.180 --> 23:18.430
A bit to the left.

23:18.920 --> 23:19.610
Okay. No, too much!

23:19.640 --> 23:20.770
Come back a little.

23:21.270 --> 23:22.110
Good, good.

23:22.750 --> 23:23.270
That's okay now.

23:23.270 --> 23:23.910
Curator.

23:29.550 --> 23:30.310
What is it?

23:32.380 --> 23:33.180
Look,

23:34.050 --> 23:36.130
I wasn't eliminated after the initial selection,

23:36.310 --> 23:37.910
so why is my name

23:37.950 --> 23:39.770
not on the final list?

23:40.310 --> 23:41.950
This was all decided by the organization.

23:41.970 --> 23:43.290
Don't overthink it.

23:43.320 --> 23:44.080
Let me tell you,

23:44.100 --> 23:45.150
our cultural museum

23:45.180 --> 23:46.460
submitted two topics this time.

23:47.140 --> 23:48.430
During the final review,

23:48.430 --> 23:50.680
the judges felt that the value orientation of your topic

23:50.690 --> 23:51.900
had some issues.

23:52.390 --> 23:53.660
So, your topic didn't receive

23:54.270 --> 23:55.110
a majority vote.

23:56.070 --> 23:57.430
Value orientation?

23:57.460 --> 23:59.400
What's wrong with the value orientation?

23:59.510 --> 24:01.230
Just listen to your topic. It's ridiculous.

24:01.230 --> 24:02.750
What's that about Su Xiaomei's shoe size?

24:02.770 --> 24:03.960
Couldn't you research something else?

24:03.990 --> 24:05.070
Why would you research Su Xiaomei's shoes?

24:05.070 --> 24:06.340
Don't you find that distasteful?

24:08.430 --> 24:11.070
Some people are even allowed to study the famous courtesans of Qinhuai,

24:11.110 --> 24:13.630
but I can't study Su Xiaomei?

24:14.790 --> 24:15.820
Let me tell you,

24:16.340 --> 24:19.340
what Chen Bo studied was the history of Chinese folk music.

24:19.590 --> 24:21.870
Su Xiaomei is just a starting point.

24:21.900 --> 24:24.670
I'm actually studying the history of ancient customs.

24:24.720 --> 24:26.980
To know what shoe size Su Xiaomei wore,

24:27.010 --> 24:29.420
we need to study whether she had bound feet.

24:29.440 --> 24:30.750
Regarding the issue of foot binding,

24:30.750 --> 24:32.150
there are currently many theories.

24:32.180 --> 24:33.820
The relatively authoritative one is that

24:33.830 --> 24:36.120
it began in the Northern Song Dynasty, flourished in the Southern Song Dynasty,

24:36.150 --> 24:38.390
and reached its peak during the Ming and Qing Dynasties.

24:38.650 --> 24:39.930
About foot binding,

24:39.950 --> 24:42.190
Su Shi held the correct attitude.

24:42.230 --> 24:43.480
He wrote a poem saying,

24:45.060 --> 24:49.840
"The delicate beauty is hard to describe; it must be seen in the palm."

24:49.860 --> 24:51.220
But Su Xiaomei

24:51.260 --> 24:53.340
had an outgoing and bold personality,

24:53.360 --> 24:54.220
and a large frame.

24:54.240 --> 24:54.830
Wait...

24:54.860 --> 24:55.780
A large frame?

24:55.800 --> 24:57.160
How did you know about that?

24:58.240 --> 25:00.980
Su Shi once teased her,

25:01.990 --> 25:04.210
"Before she steps out of the courtyard,

25:04.240 --> 25:07.130
her forehead has already reached the main hall."

25:07.160 --> 25:08.940
You see, if a girl like this

25:09.070 --> 25:10.280
didn't want to bind her feet,

25:10.310 --> 25:12.310
even Su Shi couldn't do anything about it.

25:12.310 --> 25:13.110
Su Xiaomei

25:13.310 --> 25:14.150
didn't bind her feet,

25:14.190 --> 25:15.390
so her feet were

25:15.390 --> 25:16.750
larger than those of ordinary women.

25:16.790 --> 25:18.300
Therefore, I conclude that

25:18.300 --> 25:20.030
she wore size 38 shoes,

25:20.060 --> 25:22.220
or at least size 35.

25:22.240 --> 25:23.500
These are all unofficial histories.

25:23.520 --> 25:25.600
Whether Su Xiaomei even existed in history

25:25.630 --> 25:27.050
is impossible to verify.

25:27.580 --> 25:28.470
Sima Guang

25:28.610 --> 25:31.790
recorded in the epitaph for Su Xun's wife,

25:32.160 --> 25:35.320
"Her young daughter had her demeanor,

25:35.340 --> 25:37.380
could compose essays, and at nineteen years old,

25:37.410 --> 25:39.230
got married and then passed away."

25:39.550 --> 25:42.060
That was about Shiniang, who married into the Cheng family.

25:42.060 --> 25:44.230
It has nothing to do with Su Xiaomei.

25:44.310 --> 25:45.610
Look, Mr. Shao,

25:45.780 --> 25:46.750
as scholars,

25:46.790 --> 25:48.910
we should make bold guesses but seek careful verification.

25:48.950 --> 25:49.790
In my opinion,

25:49.810 --> 25:50.940
you're only left with boldness.

25:53.410 --> 25:55.500
Well, if you don't like me, so be it.

25:55.500 --> 25:56.510
Can you tell me

25:56.510 --> 25:58.830
who got the special grant this time?

26:00.680 --> 26:01.470
Chen Bo.

26:04.910 --> 26:06.220
Just as I expected.

26:06.700 --> 26:08.890
It's exactly as I thought!

26:08.930 --> 26:09.970
Let me tell you,

26:09.990 --> 26:11.400
Chen Bo's research topic

26:11.420 --> 26:13.590
is about the dialect changes in the Honghuai region,

26:13.610 --> 26:14.990
and through these dialect changes,

26:15.010 --> 26:16.090
examining the role of the Grand Canal

26:16.120 --> 26:18.680
in our country's economic and cultural exchanges.

26:18.700 --> 26:20.780
Well, his topic doesn't seem anything new, either.

26:20.820 --> 26:22.370
It sounds so boring.

26:22.390 --> 26:23.920
Well, why don't you come up with an interesting one

26:23.950 --> 26:25.870
so that a publishing house would reach out to you?

26:25.890 --> 26:26.650
A publishing house?

26:27.210 --> 26:27.750
No, no, no.

26:27.790 --> 26:29.520
Curator, wait a minute.

26:29.570 --> 26:31.120
What do you mean by "a publishing house"?

26:31.150 --> 26:32.310
A publishing house

26:32.310 --> 26:33.790
was interested in Chen Bo's research topic.

26:34.030 --> 26:35.510
They said his materials are substantial,

26:35.550 --> 26:36.670
and the visual materials are also abundant.

26:36.710 --> 26:37.750
They planned to publish his book.

26:37.870 --> 26:39.350
Which publishing house is it?

26:39.370 --> 26:40.290
It's from another province.

26:40.320 --> 26:41.820
The contract is almost signed.

26:41.950 --> 26:43.270
They say the first print run

26:43.710 --> 26:44.620
will be 8,000 copies.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.690
8,000?

26:46.080 --> 26:48.770
[No smoking]

26:46.180 --> 26:46.980
Just for him?

26:47.150 --> 26:48.850
Is the publishing house crazy?

26:48.910 --> 26:50.030
If you're so dissatisfied,

26:50.060 --> 26:51.920
why don't you submit your work to a publishing house too?

26:52.030 --> 26:53.350
Look, Mr. Shao,

26:53.600 --> 26:55.300
we're both in the writing business.

26:55.330 --> 26:56.410
Whether you're truly capable or not,

26:56.430 --> 26:57.430
you've got to take the test.

27:14.040 --> 27:14.830
You're back.

27:15.610 --> 27:16.440
How was the meeting?

27:18.290 --> 27:19.630
Not so good.

27:26.060 --> 27:27.040
Congratulations.

27:27.350 --> 27:28.810
Congratulations.

27:32.100 --> 27:33.280
Are you talking to me?

27:34.040 --> 27:35.280
What are you congratulating me for?

27:35.320 --> 27:37.070
Aren't you going to publish a book?

27:38.140 --> 27:39.630
It's just an intention.

27:39.660 --> 27:41.090
It's far from certain.

27:41.370 --> 27:42.600
How did the publishing house

27:43.020 --> 27:44.220
reach out to you?

27:44.240 --> 27:45.320
A schoolfellow of mine

27:45.350 --> 27:46.640
works as an editor at the publishing house.

27:46.700 --> 27:47.790
One day, he asked me,

27:48.290 --> 27:49.190
"What are you up to these days?"

27:49.990 --> 27:51.480
So, I sent him

27:51.500 --> 27:52.330
my manuscript.

27:52.370 --> 27:53.360
Unexpectedly,

27:53.560 --> 27:54.820
they liked it at first sight.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.830
For this kind of subject matter,

27:57.390 --> 27:58.470
they'd do an initial print run of 8,000 copies?

27:58.590 --> 27:59.310
Yeah.

27:59.690 --> 28:00.570
I was worried.

28:01.210 --> 28:02.810
The topic is too niche.

28:02.830 --> 28:04.250
Not many people are interested in it.

28:06.270 --> 28:06.870
Don't worry.

28:06.910 --> 28:08.130
Isn't your wife there to help?

28:10.300 --> 28:12.020
What does this have to do with my wife?

28:17.870 --> 28:19.880
It's a book about canals.

28:20.630 --> 28:22.510
The government can buy some as gifts.

28:23.770 --> 28:25.500
It can sell no matter how many copies are printed.

28:25.710 --> 28:26.910
Eight thousand is even too few.

28:26.940 --> 28:28.700
It's not like they're spending their own money anyway.

28:29.290 --> 28:30.270
Let me tell you,

28:30.310 --> 28:32.110
my wife doesn't interfere with my affairs at all.

28:32.150 --> 28:33.260
She can't be bothered.

28:33.290 --> 28:34.440
She doesn't need to interfere with it.

28:35.020 --> 28:36.630
As long as her subordinates have some sense,

28:36.630 --> 28:37.790
they'll take care of it themselves.

28:37.820 --> 28:39.060
The district chief,

28:39.080 --> 28:40.890
although not a high-ranking official,

28:40.910 --> 28:42.710
can still be useful at crucial moments.

28:43.340 --> 28:44.360
Take

28:45.240 --> 28:47.990
the special grant this time for example. Right?

28:50.340 --> 28:51.130
Shao,

28:52.590 --> 28:53.920
make it clear.

28:54.450 --> 28:56.840
What does the project grant have to do with my wife?

28:59.630 --> 29:01.040
Whether there's a connection or not,

29:01.700 --> 29:03.460
don't you know in your heart?

29:03.950 --> 29:04.750
No, no, no.

29:04.750 --> 29:05.670
I don't know.

29:05.710 --> 29:06.500
This needs to be clarified.

29:06.550 --> 29:07.030
Help!

29:07.030 --> 29:07.820
With my wife...

29:07.870 --> 29:08.870
Help!

29:08.870 --> 29:09.800
-Why are you yelling for help?
-He's hitting me!

29:09.800 --> 29:10.870
Explain clearly!

29:10.910 --> 29:11.950
Can you explain clearly or not?

29:11.950 --> 29:12.910
What's going on here?

29:12.910 --> 29:13.910
What's happening?

29:13.910 --> 29:14.990
Is that how you talk to people?

29:15.030 --> 29:16.050
Let go!

29:16.300 --> 29:16.860
You tell him

29:16.880 --> 29:18.170
about the project grant,

29:18.200 --> 29:19.440
did my wife interfere or not?

29:19.460 --> 29:21.590
You know well whether she interfered or not.

29:21.620 --> 29:22.180
Let me tell you,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.920
stop acting all righteous every day.

29:23.950 --> 29:26.000
Be careful, or I'll report you and that wife of yours

29:26.020 --> 29:27.220
for abusing your power for personal gain

29:27.250 --> 29:28.450
and suppressing your colleagues.

29:28.780 --> 29:29.720
Curator, he's…

29:29.740 --> 29:30.250
Stop right there!

29:30.290 --> 29:31.410
I said stop!

29:31.420 --> 29:31.900
Stop!

29:31.940 --> 29:32.540
Come back here!

29:32.560 --> 29:34.080
Did you hear how he was talking?

29:34.370 --> 29:36.050
You're an educated person,

29:36.080 --> 29:37.040
but you were fighting here.

29:37.060 --> 29:37.470
Aren't you ashamed?

29:37.510 --> 29:39.230
He threatened to report me. Did you hear that?

29:39.810 --> 29:41.180
What's he reporting you for?

29:41.190 --> 29:42.110
Sit down.

29:42.150 --> 29:43.340
Calm down, calm down.

29:43.370 --> 29:43.880
Come on.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.780
Don't bother with people like that.

29:47.450 --> 29:48.260
Just calm down.

29:51.670 --> 29:53.290
What kind of person is he?

29:55.790 --> 30:03.260
[Heaven rewards the diligent]

29:55.870 --> 29:57.120
Drink less.

29:57.150 --> 29:58.520
Drinking too much is bad for your liver.

30:01.960 --> 30:03.450
Drinking harms the liver,

30:03.470 --> 30:04.550
but if I don't drink, my heart hurts.

30:06.780 --> 30:08.520
Isn't it just a project grant?

30:08.570 --> 30:10.720
Is it really worth getting so upset over a few thousand yuan?

30:10.760 --> 30:12.390
It's not about the money at all.

30:12.430 --> 30:13.950
This is about dignity!

30:15.130 --> 30:16.750
You wouldn't understand even if I explained it to you.

30:20.990 --> 30:22.030
We're both writers.

30:22.580 --> 30:24.540
Why does he get the project grant?

30:25.440 --> 30:27.050
Isn't it just because he has a well-connected wife?

30:28.320 --> 30:29.240
District chief.

30:29.240 --> 30:30.270
The head of a district.

30:31.060 --> 30:32.070
She dares to abuse power for personal gain

30:32.070 --> 30:33.350
and seek benefits for her family members.

30:33.800 --> 30:35.650
Doesn't she fear divine retribution?

30:36.120 --> 30:37.940
You shouldn't say such things carelessly.

30:38.230 --> 30:39.700
Mind your words to accumulate virtue.

30:39.780 --> 30:40.790
They don't even accumulate virtue.

30:40.790 --> 30:42.790
Why should I be the one to watch my words?

30:42.790 --> 30:44.070
Do you know how much effort

30:44.070 --> 30:45.720
I've poured into the topic of Su Xiaomei?

30:45.750 --> 30:48.550
Do you know how many trips I made to the library?

30:48.580 --> 30:49.860
To put it bluntly,

30:49.880 --> 30:51.200
even if I don't deserve credit,

30:51.230 --> 30:52.830
I should at least get credit for my hard work, right?

30:52.950 --> 30:54.060
Yes.

30:55.620 --> 30:56.840
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

30:57.470 --> 30:59.660
If it hurts, then stop talking so much.

31:00.070 --> 31:01.460
It's not such a big deal.

31:01.670 --> 31:02.960
It's not a big deal?

31:03.150 --> 31:04.720
Isn't this a big deal?

31:04.750 --> 31:06.370
What would you call a big deal then?

31:07.030 --> 31:07.800
Abusing power for personal gain.

31:07.830 --> 31:08.920
Swindling and plundering.

31:08.960 --> 31:10.150
If I don't speak up,

31:10.150 --> 31:11.660
I'll be bullied to death by them!

31:11.690 --> 31:12.450
Dad,

31:12.480 --> 31:13.950
could you please keep it down?

31:13.980 --> 31:15.690
Adults are talking. Why are you butting in, kid?

31:15.700 --> 31:16.500
Shut up!

31:16.530 --> 31:17.150
Alright.

31:17.150 --> 31:18.470
Why are you yelling at him?

31:18.470 --> 31:19.990
He didn't say anything wrong.

31:20.110 --> 31:21.890
And you're a graduate of a prestigious school.

31:21.920 --> 31:23.120
You're as petty as…

31:23.150 --> 31:24.150
I'm petty?

31:24.180 --> 31:25.720
I'm petty?

31:25.940 --> 31:27.180
I can't even criticize him now. Is that it?

31:27.200 --> 31:27.550
Alright, alright.

31:27.570 --> 31:28.700
What do you mean "alright"?

31:29.800 --> 31:30.190
Mom!

31:30.190 --> 31:30.790
Yuling.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.320
Don't touch my mom!

31:32.670 --> 31:34.220
If you get drunk and act crazy again,

31:34.260 --> 31:35.740
I'll report you to your workplace for domestic violence!

31:35.760 --> 31:37.770
Xingchi, Xingchi.

31:37.800 --> 31:38.830
Don't yell at your father.

31:38.860 --> 31:39.920
Mom's fine.

31:40.150 --> 31:40.670
I'm okay.

31:40.670 --> 31:41.230
Can you move?

31:53.060 --> 31:58.550
[Midnight Eats]

31:53.110 --> 31:53.780
Bro.

31:55.330 --> 31:55.910
Lao'er.

31:55.940 --> 31:56.790
Come, have a seat.

31:57.400 --> 31:58.090
Yue'er.

31:58.120 --> 31:59.600
Get us another glass.

31:59.870 --> 32:00.470
Okay.

32:01.300 --> 32:01.990
You're drinking?

32:01.990 --> 32:03.470
Of course.

32:04.860 --> 32:05.460
Come on.

32:07.770 --> 32:09.230
I... I'll pass.

32:09.230 --> 32:11.090
My liver's been hurting these past couple of days.

32:11.230 --> 32:12.350
What do you mean your liver hurts?

32:12.510 --> 32:13.740
At most, you've got a fatty liver.

32:13.770 --> 32:14.930
It's not like you have cirrhosis.

32:14.970 --> 32:15.530
What's the matter?

32:15.550 --> 32:16.870
Getting all delicate now, are you?

32:17.330 --> 32:18.520
She... you know...

32:20.070 --> 32:21.360
You mean Yan?

32:21.550 --> 32:22.350
Just tell her

32:22.390 --> 32:23.430
that I make you drink.

32:23.460 --> 32:24.410
What's the problem?

32:24.800 --> 32:25.710
Al... alright then.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.270
Well...

32:36.830 --> 32:37.940
Have you gotten the money back?

32:41.020 --> 32:42.160
What should we do?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.620
In a couple of days,

32:44.220 --> 32:46.230
I won't even have money for gas.

32:54.960 --> 32:55.840
Cheers!

32:56.540 --> 32:57.350
Cheers!

33:15.600 --> 33:17.000
How about some stir-fried river snails?

33:18.370 --> 33:19.730
Ri... river snails.

33:19.800 --> 33:21.030
Bring us some river snails.

33:21.110 --> 33:21.910
Right away.

33:21.930 --> 33:22.930
Extra spicy, okay?

33:22.970 --> 33:23.330
Okay.

33:23.350 --> 33:24.490
Yes, yes, yes.

33:28.010 --> 33:29.110
Fill it up.

33:49.530 --> 33:50.560
You're back.

33:53.840 --> 33:54.720
You've been drinking again.

33:54.760 --> 33:55.530
Well, on my way home...

33:55.550 --> 33:57.420
I ran into Lao'er.

33:57.450 --> 33:59.430
I just took a sip.

34:00.020 --> 34:01.560
I'm going to bed now.

34:02.270 --> 34:03.200
Son,

34:03.320 --> 34:05.120
do you know someone called Jay Chou?

34:05.150 --> 34:05.750
Yes, I do.

34:05.780 --> 34:07.200
He's quite popular now.

34:07.220 --> 34:09.130
His songs are played everywhere on the streets.

34:09.670 --> 34:11.639
One of his songs is pretty good.

34:11.659 --> 34:13.739
It's called... "Listen…"

34:13.770 --> 34:16.360
"Listen to Mom."

34:17.360 --> 34:18.719
Go out and learn it.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.790
When you've learned it, sing it for

34:20.100 --> 34:20.860
your mom.

34:21.080 --> 34:22.110
Okay, okay, okay.

34:22.139 --> 34:23.190
You should listen too.

34:23.210 --> 34:24.420
Listen to my mom

34:24.760 --> 34:25.760
You should drink less.

34:42.889 --> 34:43.900
What is this?

34:44.870 --> 34:46.260
I'm asking you, what is this?

35:01.860 --> 35:03.820
This little brat.

35:04.810 --> 35:05.800
You little brat.

35:05.820 --> 35:06.480
What are you doing?

35:06.550 --> 35:07.490
You're not even fully grown yet.

35:07.950 --> 35:09.100
What are you doing?

35:09.150 --> 35:10.110
Don't wrongly accuse our son.

35:10.140 --> 35:11.140
It's yours!

35:11.320 --> 35:13.160
It's from your pocket.

35:14.140 --> 35:15.270
No way, no way.

35:15.270 --> 35:17.220
I... I never use this thing.

35:18.100 --> 35:19.630
You... don't falsely accuse me.

35:19.670 --> 35:20.710
Am I falsely accusing you?

35:20.710 --> 35:21.840
If it's not yours, is it mine?

35:21.860 --> 35:23.460
Our son can testify to it.

35:23.970 --> 35:24.540
It's yours.

35:27.910 --> 35:28.990
Xie Tiancheng.

35:28.990 --> 35:30.620
What have you done?

35:30.700 --> 35:31.140
Mom.

35:31.140 --> 35:32.430
What did you do outside?

35:33.320 --> 35:34.540
What have you done?

35:34.540 --> 35:35.440
Stop it, Mom.

35:35.440 --> 35:36.190
Get away.

35:40.030 --> 35:40.750
Explain it to me clearly.

35:40.750 --> 35:42.000
If you don't explain it to me clearly,

35:42.040 --> 35:43.600
let's just separate!

35:43.630 --> 35:44.300
Tell!

35:44.310 --> 35:44.930
Whose is it?

35:44.960 --> 35:46.000
Don't pinch me here. Not here!

35:46.020 --> 35:47.100
Tell it!

35:47.830 --> 35:48.350
No…

35:48.390 --> 35:49.190
Whose is it really?

35:49.190 --> 35:49.750
Wait…

35:49.790 --> 35:50.990
If you dare lie to me, you'll see the consequences.

35:51.030 --> 35:51.750
Speak!

35:56.910 --> 35:57.740
Take it easy.

35:59.370 --> 36:00.060
No need.

36:00.060 --> 36:01.350
Just a slap.

36:01.370 --> 36:02.060
It's not that bad.

36:02.090 --> 36:03.760
Hurry up. The ice pack will help.

36:07.940 --> 36:08.970
What happened to your face?

36:11.030 --> 36:12.190
He stood up to his father

36:12.310 --> 36:13.340
and got put down.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.720
Here, do it yourself.

36:18.070 --> 36:19.640
Did he hit your mom again?

36:22.190 --> 36:23.240
My mom's back is injured.

36:23.260 --> 36:24.300
It's all bruised now.

36:25.290 --> 36:26.830
I don't know if she can even walk tomorrow.

36:26.860 --> 36:28.070
Sometimes I really want to...

36:28.090 --> 36:29.570
Don't do anything rash.

36:30.020 --> 36:31.710
No matter what, he's still your father.

36:35.590 --> 36:36.650
You know what?

36:36.680 --> 36:37.930
In this regard,

36:38.020 --> 36:39.550
my dad is a model example.

36:40.470 --> 36:41.370
Listen.

36:42.590 --> 36:44.070
No matter how badly he's beaten,

36:44.110 --> 36:45.520
he never fights back.

36:49.400 --> 36:52.170
When will this kind of life end?

36:54.430 --> 36:56.140
If today is unbearable,

36:56.430 --> 36:57.970
just think about tomorrow.

36:58.980 --> 37:00.290
In a few years,

37:00.440 --> 37:01.880
when we've all made it,

37:01.910 --> 37:03.540
earning millions a year,

37:03.910 --> 37:04.750
by then,

37:04.790 --> 37:06.420
every family will have bought a new house.

37:06.450 --> 37:07.850
At that time, when our parents gather every day,

37:07.890 --> 37:09.970
they'll just play mahjong and chat about their kids.

37:10.000 --> 37:11.800
Our biggest worry then

37:11.840 --> 37:12.970
won't be making money,

37:13.860 --> 37:15.850
but our parents being extremely bored

37:16.260 --> 37:17.220
and hence

37:17.700 --> 37:18.610
pressuring us to get married.

37:20.250 --> 37:21.290
Just imagine that life.

37:22.120 --> 37:23.190
I'm telling you,

37:23.490 --> 37:25.400
Siyi definitely won't be pressured to marry.

37:25.430 --> 37:26.560
She'll definitely marry early.

37:27.230 --> 37:27.940
Why?

37:28.170 --> 37:29.840
She's beautiful and smart,

37:29.870 --> 37:30.780
and sensible too.

37:30.810 --> 37:31.970
By then, she'll get into a good university.

37:31.990 --> 37:33.160
I bet she'll be

37:33.190 --> 37:34.650
snatched up before she even graduates.

37:34.670 --> 37:35.640
That's how it was with my parents.

37:36.260 --> 37:36.900
My mom

37:36.920 --> 37:38.080
graduated from the Opera Academy,

37:38.120 --> 37:39.290
specializing in qingyi roles.

37:39.940 --> 37:41.300
The first time she performed on stage,

37:41.320 --> 37:42.600
my dad spotted her.

37:42.640 --> 37:44.720
At first, she really looked down on my dad.

37:44.760 --> 37:45.520
But you know what?

37:45.830 --> 37:47.140
On their first date,

37:47.580 --> 37:49.380
my dad cooked a meal for my mom.

37:49.440 --> 37:50.550
He won her over just like that.

38:23.350 --> 38:24.030
Hello?

38:24.050 --> 38:24.930
Linlin,

38:24.990 --> 38:26.720
I watched that TV series.

38:26.880 --> 38:28.250
It was so well made.

38:28.290 --> 38:29.220
It was okay, right?

38:29.240 --> 38:30.410
Not just okay.

38:30.440 --> 38:31.690
It was excellent!

38:31.780 --> 38:32.720
It didn't feel like a TV series,

38:32.750 --> 38:33.940
but more like a movie.

38:34.410 --> 38:35.820
That play you mentioned before—

38:35.840 --> 38:37.360
can I still audition for it?

38:37.530 --> 38:38.510
Of course you can.

38:39.090 --> 38:40.850
Then please help me get in touch with them quickly.

38:40.870 --> 38:41.870
As soon as I finish shooting tomorrow,

38:41.900 --> 38:43.020
I'll head to Beijing right away.

38:43.050 --> 38:44.340
Wait, has your husband agreed?

38:44.370 --> 38:45.840
For such a great director,

38:45.880 --> 38:47.300
I have to give it a shot no matter what.

38:47.330 --> 38:48.250
Don't you think so?

38:48.310 --> 38:49.630
Alright, I'll ask about it.

38:49.660 --> 38:50.760
Okay, okay.

38:50.870 --> 38:52.350
I'll wait for your news then.

38:52.680 --> 38:54.260
And about the Liu family…

38:54.710 --> 38:55.630
Dad, you're back.

38:56.720 --> 38:57.160
Dad.

38:57.180 --> 38:58.170
Have you been drinking?

38:58.880 --> 39:00.420
I just had a little.

39:00.450 --> 39:01.210
With whom?

39:02.420 --> 39:03.540
Just by myself.

39:05.060 --> 39:05.700
Well...

39:06.050 --> 39:07.280
I'm going to my room.

39:07.310 --> 39:09.450
It's not like Zhimei isn't coming back.

39:14.050 --> 39:14.680
Dad,

39:16.080 --> 39:17.270
she

39:17.290 --> 39:19.420
only comes home a few days a year.

39:19.450 --> 39:21.040
What's the difference between that and not coming back at all?

39:22.210 --> 39:24.140
She's contributing to the family.

39:24.170 --> 39:25.720
You call that a contribution?

39:27.390 --> 39:28.470
Her contribution should be

39:28.470 --> 39:30.880
taking care of this home for me.

39:31.040 --> 39:32.870
She should be looking after Haikuo.

39:33.610 --> 39:35.080
He's already in his final year of high school.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.890
What are you waiting for?

39:38.280 --> 39:39.270
Go study now.

39:39.330 --> 39:41.040
Go take a shower quickly.

39:52.840 --> 39:54.040
I really didn't lie to you.

39:55.200 --> 39:57.040
I really went to collect the debt

39:57.080 --> 39:58.910
from Crippled Sun.

39:59.420 --> 40:01.530
That thick-skinned brute refused to pay me.

40:01.980 --> 40:03.370
He tried to pawn things off to settle the debt,

40:03.500 --> 40:06.110
stuffing anything he grabbed into my pockets.

40:06.590 --> 40:09.840
I gave back everything to him,

40:10.050 --> 40:13.530
but I didn't notice it because it was too small.

40:15.060 --> 40:16.020
Don't be mad anymore, okay?

40:17.060 --> 40:17.580
Alright?

40:18.300 --> 40:19.230
That money—

40:19.950 --> 40:21.830
we won't get it back forever, right?

40:23.320 --> 40:23.720
Well,

40:23.750 --> 40:24.720
that's not possible.

40:25.260 --> 40:26.500
I must get it back from him.

40:26.520 --> 40:27.570
What can you do?

40:30.280 --> 40:32.570
If he doesn't pay me back by the end of the month,

40:32.670 --> 40:33.580
I'll fight him to the death.

40:36.710 --> 40:38.040
Don't do anything reckless, you hear me?

40:38.080 --> 40:38.770
Money is not important.

40:38.800 --> 40:39.820
You can't get into trouble.

40:40.030 --> 40:40.790
If something happens to you,

40:40.810 --> 40:41.860
what will our son and I do?

40:41.890 --> 40:42.850
Do you understand?

40:42.870 --> 40:43.550
Don't worry.

40:43.630 --> 40:44.500
Rest assured.

40:44.530 --> 40:47.870
I won't do anything illegal, I promise.

40:54.470 --> 40:55.390
Just now,

40:56.870 --> 40:58.270
did I hurt you?

40:59.420 --> 41:00.230
What do you think?

41:03.670 --> 41:05.140
Have you practiced the Nine Yin White Bone Claw?

41:05.170 --> 41:06.820
You scratched, pinched, and clawed.

41:07.630 --> 41:09.590
I was just feeling anxious.

41:09.800 --> 41:12.290
We haven't had any income for months.

41:12.310 --> 41:15.190
We still owe several families their dividends.

41:15.540 --> 41:17.410
I'm too embarrassed to face them.

41:17.440 --> 41:18.360
You know,

41:19.160 --> 41:20.980
if it were just our own business,

41:21.000 --> 41:21.880
even if we lose money,

41:21.920 --> 41:22.960
I could accept that.

41:22.980 --> 41:24.180
At worst, we'll just

41:24.220 --> 41:26.250
spend less.

41:26.300 --> 41:27.770
We'd get through it somehow.

41:27.790 --> 41:29.870
But I'm afraid of letting down our neighbors.

41:32.330 --> 41:33.650
The other families are fine,

41:33.980 --> 41:35.650
but considering Granny Ma's situation...

41:40.110 --> 41:41.990
I feel guilty.

41:42.890 --> 41:44.090
I'm really sorry.

41:44.120 --> 41:46.480
We should blame that Crippled Sun.

41:46.510 --> 41:48.940
He drives a Mercedes to the nightclub,

41:48.970 --> 41:50.700
blowing thousands in one night,

41:51.250 --> 41:52.540
but he doesn't pay back the money he owes.

41:52.560 --> 41:54.370
What kind of person is that?

42:40.240 --> 42:41.590
You're smart enough.

42:42.710 --> 42:43.920
Why are you here?

42:44.490 --> 42:46.770
I saw you leaving home earlier, and you seemed upset.

42:46.840 --> 42:48.160
I was worried something might happen to you,

42:48.190 --> 42:49.440
so I followed you all the way here.

42:49.710 --> 42:50.870
What could possibly happen to me?

42:54.890 --> 42:55.690
Let's go.

42:56.910 --> 42:58.630
What are you hissing at? Come with me!
